WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.734
-Guys, finally, it is Tuesday.
It is time for "WeTweet."

00:00:02.734 --> 00:00:03.767
Here we go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:07.601
-♪ WeTweet ♪

00:00:07.601 --> 00:00:09.334
♪♪

00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:11.534
♪ WeTweet ♪
-Welcome to "WeTweet."

00:00:11.534 --> 00:00:14.400
This is where we as a group
decide something

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.934
that we should post on Twitter.

00:00:15.934 --> 00:00:17.901
I'm going to show you a series
of different tweets.

00:00:17.901 --> 00:00:18.968
Then we're all going to vote on

00:00:18.968 --> 00:00:20.334
whether you like
each one or not.

00:00:20.334 --> 00:00:22.267
You all have voting clickers
at your seats.

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:24.767
You can vote for all of them.
You can vote for none of them.

00:00:24.767 --> 00:00:26.801
Whatever you want, but we're
going to see the results

00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:27.968
live here on the show.

00:00:27.968 --> 00:00:29.100
Higgins, Roots,

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.167
you guys have your clickers too?
-Got it.

00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:31.601
-Whatever tweet
gets the most likes,

00:00:31.601 --> 00:00:33.400
we will tweet it out
live on the show

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:36.667
so that you can all like it
and "WeTweet" it.

00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:38.100
It's a shared experience.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.334
Okay, you guys ready for this?

00:00:39.334 --> 00:00:41.667
[ Cheers ]
Alright.

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:43.334
The first tweet is...

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:47.467
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:47.467 --> 00:00:48.734
♪♪

00:00:48.734 --> 00:00:50.400
-[ Chuckles ] Wow.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.334
-"Get in --
Get in that locker, nerd!"

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:54.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.868 --> 00:00:55.834
-Alright. Here we go.

00:00:55.834 --> 00:00:56.801
Everyone has made
their decision.

00:00:56.801 --> 00:00:57.734
The votes are in.

00:00:57.734 --> 00:00:59.200
Let's see the results here.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:00.667
[ Drum roll ]

00:01:00.667 --> 00:01:01.667
Alright, okay.

00:01:01.667 --> 00:01:03.534
Half and half.

00:01:03.534 --> 00:01:04.834
Okay.

00:01:04.834 --> 00:01:06.834
Lukewarm reception to that one.

00:01:06.834 --> 00:01:08.067
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah. Tepid, tepid.

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:09.601
-Alright, this next one is...

00:01:14.868 --> 00:01:17.000
[ Laughter ]
See, is it corn pops?

00:01:19.334 --> 00:01:22.234
Okay, I feel like everyone kind
of made their decision fast.

00:01:22.234 --> 00:01:23.367
-Yeah, this one
is going to be a little low.

00:01:23.367 --> 00:01:24.834
-Let's see the results.

00:01:26.501 --> 00:01:29.000
-Whoa!

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.434
That's well-balanced.
-No, are they getting --

00:01:30.434 --> 00:01:32.834
they get --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.834 --> 00:01:33.934
That is well-balanced.

00:01:37.734 --> 00:01:39.300
Let's take a look at
this next one. Here it says...

00:01:42.834 --> 00:01:44.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.634 --> 00:01:46.467
As faster you can get on there,
the better.

00:01:46.467 --> 00:01:49.200
Alright, Tariq is thinking about
that a little bit.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:51.667
So, I think this might do better
than 90-something.

00:01:51.667 --> 00:01:53.701
Let's see the results
on this one here.

00:01:53.701 --> 00:01:55.467
[ Drum roll ]

00:01:55.467 --> 00:01:57.300
Alright, that's not bad.

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:58.734
There we go.

00:01:58.734 --> 00:02:00.834
139, I'll take that.
-Wow, 1-3-9.

00:02:00.834 --> 00:02:02.601
-Yeah, that's good.
Alright, here we go.

00:02:02.601 --> 00:02:03.434
The next one says...

00:02:06.467 --> 00:02:08.200
[ Laughter ]
-Yes.

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:11.434
See? That was a yes.
-It does a little bit.

00:02:11.434 --> 00:02:13.834
You're like, "Ah,
still got take Monday haze."

00:02:13.834 --> 00:02:15.300
Okay, here we go.

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:16.367
Let's see the results.

00:02:16.367 --> 00:02:17.901
[ Drum roll ]

00:02:17.901 --> 00:02:19.267
There you go!
-Oh! There we go.

00:02:19.267 --> 00:02:20.601
-I knew that one.

00:02:20.601 --> 00:02:21.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:21.501 --> 00:02:23.567
That's the winner right there!

00:02:23.567 --> 00:02:24.868
I'm going to post this!

00:02:24.868 --> 00:02:26.534
[ Bell dinging ]

00:02:26.534 --> 00:02:28.934
I'm going to post this during
the commercial break.

00:02:28.934 --> 00:02:30.234
If you see it on your feed,

00:02:30.234 --> 00:02:32.300
give it a like,
give it a WeTweet.

